{"id": "db1f96af-4db8-4718-b5ed-2870b9d74b46", "slug": "immersive-experience-1", "title": "Immersive Experience", "description": "Immersive Experience Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Immersive Experience\"\ndescription: \"Immersive Experience Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#020617\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#020617\"\n  background: \"#020617\"\n  surface: \"#18181B\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"16px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Immersive Experience\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Sourasith Phomhome (@madebysourasith). Views: 10; favorites: 3; remixes: 1.\nTags: feature, section, animated, bento, charts.\n## Overview\nImmersive Experience Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nNEXUS Initialize Prepare to immerse. Scroll System Backbone Engineered for limitless scale and total accuracy. Synaptic Compute Next-gen processing layers balance live data streams throughout decentralized grids. Entang…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Prepare to immerse.; System Backbone; Engineered for limitless scale and total accuracy.; Synaptic Compute; Entangled Pathways; Cryptographic Core.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #020617, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #020617, background #020617, surface #18181B, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Immersive Experience</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#020617] text-slate-200 antialiased selection:bg-blue-500/30 overflow-x-hidden font-[Inter]\" style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; min-height: 100vh;\">\n\n    <!-- Subtle Diagonal Background Texture Layer (Framed Grid Skill) -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none z-0\" style=\"background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(-45deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.015) 0px, rgba(255,255,255,0.015) 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 12px);\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Container Lines Overlay (Global Grid) -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none z-50 flex justify-center\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <div class=\"w-full max-w-7xl h-full border-x border-white/[0.04] relative\">\n            <!-- Corner Squares -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 -left-[2.5px] w-[4px] h-[4px] border border-white/20 bg-[#020617]\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 -right-[2.5px] w-[4px] h-[4px] border border-white/20 bg-[#020617]\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 -left-[2.5px] w-[4px] h-[4px] border border-white/20 bg-[#020617]\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 -right-[2.5px] w-[4px] h-[4px] border border-white/20 bg-[#020617]\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Quarter marks -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-1/4 -left-[2.5px] w-[4px] h-[4px] border border-white/10 bg-[#020617]\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-1/4 -right-[2.5px] w-[4px] h-[4px] border border-white/10 bg-[#020617]\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-2/4 -left-[2.5px] w-[4px] h-[4px] border border-white/10 bg-[#020617]\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-2/4 -right-[2.5px] w-[4px] h-[4px] border border-white/10 bg-[#020617]\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-3/4 -left-[2.5px] w-[4px] h-[4px] border border-white/10 bg-[#020617]\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-3/4 -right-[2.5px] w-[4px] h-[4px] border border-white/10 bg-[#020617]\"></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Main Navigation -->\n    <nav class=\"fixed top-0 left-0 w-full z-40 px-10 py-10 flex justify-between items-center mix-blend-difference\">\n        <div class=\"text-white tracking-tight text-sm font-medium\">NEXUS</div>\n        <button class=\"text-white text-xs tracking-wider uppercase border border-white/20 px-4 py-2 rounded-full hover:bg-white hover:text-black transition-colors duration-300\">Initialize</button>\n    </nav>\n\n    <!-- Section 1: Hero -->\n    <section class=\"p-4 md:p-6 h-screen w-full relative z-10 box-border\">\n        <div class=\"relative w-full h-full border border-white/10 overflow-hidden bg-black flex flex-col items-center justify-center\">\n\n            <!-- L-Brackets -->\n            <div class=\"absolute -top-[1px] -left-[1px] w-4 h-4 border-t border-l border-white/40 z-20 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute -top-[1px] -right-[1px] w-4 h-4 border-t border-r border-white/40 z-20 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute -bottom-[1px] -left-[1px] w-4 h-4 border-b border-l border-white/40 z-20 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute -bottom-[1px] -right-[1px] w-4 h-4 border-b border-r border-white/40 z-20 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n            <!-- WebGL Canvas for Warp Effect -->\n            <canvas id=\"warp-canvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover z-0\"></canvas>\n\n            <!-- Text Content -->\n            <div class=\"relative z-10 text-center px-4 mix-blend-plus-lighter\">\n                <h1 class=\"text-6xl md:text-8xl tracking-tighter text-white font-normal leading-[1.05] masked-title\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.04em;\">Prepare<br>to immerse.</h1>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-10 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-10 flex flex-col items-center gap-2 opacity-50\">\n                <span class=\"text-xs tracking-widest uppercase\">Scroll</span>\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-down-linear\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"animate-bounce\"></iconify-icon>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Section 2: Features -->\n    <section class=\"px-4 pb-4 md:px-6 md:pb-6 w-full relative z-10 box-border\">\n        <div class=\"relative w-full py-32 md:py-48 border border-white/10 overflow-hidden bg-[#020617]\">\n\n            <!-- L-Brackets -->\n            <div class=\"absolute -top-[1px] -left-[1px] w-4 h-4 border-t border-l border-white/40 z-20 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute -top-[1px] -right-[1px] w-4 h-4 border-t border-r border-white/40 z-20 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute -bottom-[1px] -left-[1px] w-4 h-4 border-b border-l border-white/40 z-20 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute -bottom-[1px] -right-[1px] w-4 h-4 border-b border-r border-white/40 z-20 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n            <!-- WebGL Canvas for Background Grid -->\n            <canvas id=\"grid-canvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover z-0 opacity-60\"></canvas>\n\n            <!-- Dark gradient overlay to blend top and bottom -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#020617] via-transparent to-[#020617] pointer-events-none z-0\"></div>\n\n            <div class=\"relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 w-full flex flex-col gap-24\">\n\n                <div class=\"max-w-2xl\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-blue-400 mb-4 masked-title\">System Backbone</h2>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl tracking-tight text-white font-normal leading-tight masked-title\">Engineered for limitless scale<br>and total accuracy.</h3>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Feature Cards Grid (Border Gradients & Aura Images) -->\n                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6\">\n\n                    <!-- Card 1 -->\n                    <div class=\"group relative rounded-2xl p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-b from-white/10 via-white/5 to-transparent hover:from-white/20 transition-colors duration-500 overflow-hidden\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-blue-500/10 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"bg-[#04091a] relative h-full w-full rounded-2xl p-6 flex flex-col gap-6\">\n                            <div class=\"w-full h-48 rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-slate-900 border border-white/5 relative\">\n                                <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/4734259a-bad7-422f-981e-ce01e79184f2_1600w.jpg\" alt=\"Abstract gradient\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover opacity-60 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-700 group-hover:scale-105\" style=\"transform-origin: center;\">\n                            </div>\n                            <div>\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:cpu-bolt-linear\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"text-blue-400 mb-3\"></iconify-icon>\n                                <h4 class=\"text-lg text-white font-medium tracking-tight mb-2\">Synaptic Compute</h4>\n                                <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed\">Next-gen processing layers balance live data streams throughout decentralized grids.</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Card 2 -->\n                    <div class=\"group relative rounded-2xl p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-b from-white/10 via-white/5 to-transparent hover:from-white/20 transition-colors duration-500 overflow-hidden\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-purple-500/10 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"bg-[#04091a] relative h-full w-full rounded-2xl p-6 flex flex-col gap-6\">\n                            <div class=\"w-full h-48 rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-slate-900 border border-white/5 relative\">\n                                <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/fa51902b-c2a4-4c33-a96e-a8f1ef67edc6_1600w.jpg\" alt=\"Neon abstract\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover opacity-60 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-700 group-hover:scale-105\" style=\"transform-origin: center;\">\n                            </div>\n                            <div>\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:network-linear\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"text-purple-400 mb-3\"></iconify-icon>\n                                <h4 class=\"text-lg text-white font-medium tracking-tight mb-2\">Entangled Pathways</h4>\n                                <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed\">Adaptive routing guarantees ultra-low latency and peak bandwidth worldwide.</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Card 3 -->\n                    <div class=\"group relative rounded-2xl p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-b from-white/10 via-white/5 to-transparent hover:from-white/20 transition-colors duration-500 overflow-hidden md:translate-y-8\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-cyan-500/10 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"bg-[#04091a] relative h-full w-full rounded-2xl p-6 flex flex-col gap-6\">\n                            <div class=\"w-full h-48 rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-slate-900 border border-white/5 relative\">\n                                <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/7f78131e-65e9-49b2-aa1f-ccc33e28df9f_1600w.webp\" alt=\"Glass architecture\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover opacity-60 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-700 group-hover:scale-105\" style=\"transform-origin: center;\">\n                            </div>\n                            <div>\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:shield-keyhole-linear\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"text-cyan-400 mb-3\"></iconify-icon>\n                                <h4 class=\"text-lg text-white font-medium tracking-tight mb-2\">Cryptographic Core</h4>\n                                <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed\">Advanced algorithmic containment secures your highest-value digital assets.</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Section 3: Global Scale -->\n    <section class=\"px-4 pb-4 md:px-6 md:pb-6 w-full relative z-10 box-border\">\n        <div class=\"relative w-full py-32 md:py-48 border border-white/10 overflow-hidden bg-[#01030a] flex items-center justify-center min-h-[90vh]\">\n\n            <!-- L-Brackets -->\n            <div class=\"absolute -top-[1px] -left-[1px] w-4 h-4 border-t border-l border-white/40 z-20 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute -top-[1px] -right-[1px] w-4 h-4 border-t border-r border-white/40 z-20 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute -bottom-[1px] -left-[1px] w-4 h-4 border-b border-l border-white/40 z-20 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute -bottom-[1px] -right-[1px] w-4 h-4 border-b border-r border-white/40 z-20 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n            <!-- WebGL Canvas for Globe -->\n            <canvas id=\"globe-canvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover z-0\"></canvas>\n\n            <!-- Content Overlay -->\n            <div class=\"relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 w-full flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-12 pointer-events-none\">\n\n                <div class=\"max-w-xl pointer-events-auto\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-indigo-400 mb-4 masked-title\">Planetary Scale</h2>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl tracking-tight text-white font-normal leading-tight mb-6 masked-title\">Deploys locally.<br>Synchronizes globally.</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-base text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-md\">Our edge infrastructure surrounds the earth with an unbroken compute layer, guaranteeing sub-millisecond latency from any origin.</p>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex gap-8\">\n                        <div>\n                            <div class=\"text-3xl text-white font-medium tracking-tight mb-1\">99.99%</div>\n                            <div class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wider\">Reliability</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"w-px bg-white/10\"></div>\n                        <div>\n                            <div class=\"text-3xl text-white font-medium tracking-tight mb-1\">10ms</div>\n                            <div class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wider\">Global Latency</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Empty div to push content left, allowing globe to show right -->\n                <div class=\"w-full md:w-1/2 h-[400px]\"></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Footer -->\n    <footer class=\"px-4 pb-4 md:px-6 md:pb-6 w-full relative z-10 box-border\">\n        <div class=\"relative w-full py-12 border border-white/10 bg-[#020617]\">\n\n            <!-- L-Brackets -->\n            <div class=\"absolute -top-[1px] -left-[1px] w-4 h-4 border-t border-l border-white/40 z-20 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute -top-[1px] -right-[1px] w-4 h-4 border-t border-r border-white/40 z-20 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute -bottom-[1px] -left-[1px] w-4 h-4 border-b border-l border-white/40 z-20 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute -bottom-[1px] -right-[1px] w-4 h-4 border-b border-r border-white/40 z-20 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n            <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-6\">\n                <div class=\"text-white tracking-tight text-sm font-medium\">NEXUS.CORE</div>\n                <div class=\"flex gap-6 text-sm text-slate-500\">\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">Platform</a>\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">Documentation</a>\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">Company</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n\n    <script>\n        // === GSAP Masked Reveal Setup ===\n        gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n        document.querySelectorAll('.masked-title').forEach(title => {\n            const htmlContent = title.innerHTML;\n            const tempDiv = document.createElement('div');\n            tempDiv.innerHTML = htmlContent;\n\n            let newHTML = '';\n\n            Array.from(tempDiv.childNodes).forEach(node => {\n                if (node.nodeName === 'BR') {\n                    newHTML += '<br>';\n                } else if (node.nodeType === 3) {\n                    const words = node.textContent.split(' ').filter(w => w.trim() !== '');\n                    words.forEach((word, i) => {\n                        newHTML += `<span style=\"display: inline-flex; overflow: hidden; vertical-align: bottom; padding-bottom: 0.1em; margin-bottom: -0.1em;\"><span class=\"word-inner\" style=\"display: inline-block; transform: translateY(110%);\">${word}</span></span>`;\n                        if (i < words.length - 1 || node.textContent.endsWith(' ')) {\n                            newHTML += ' ';\n                        }\n                    });\n                }\n            });\n\n            title.innerHTML = newHTML;\n\n            const innerSpans = title.querySelectorAll('.word-inner');\n            if(innerSpans.length > 0) {\n                gsap.to(innerSpans, {\n                    y: '0%',\n                    duration: 1.2,\n                    ease: 'power4.out',\n                    stagger: 0.05,\n                    scrollTrigger: {\n                        trigger: title,\n                        start: 'top 85%',\n                        toggleActions: 'play none none none'\n                    }\n                });\n            }\n        });\n\n\n        // === Three.js WebGL Utilities ===\n        const createRenderer = (canvasId) => {\n            const canvas = document.getElementById(canvasId);\n            const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ canvas, alpha: true, antialias: true, powerPreference: \"high-performance\" });\n            renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n            renderer.setSize(canvas.clientWidth, canvas.clientHeight);\n            return { canvas, renderer };\n        };\n\n\n        // === 1. Hero Warp Effect ===\n        const initWarp = () => {\n            const { canvas, renderer } = createRenderer('warp-canvas');\n            const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n            scene.background = new THREE.Color(0x02040a);\n            scene.fog = new THREE.FogExp2(0x02040a, 0.001);\n\n            const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(75, canvas.clientWidth / canvas.clientHeight, 0.1, 2000);\n            camera.position.z = 0;\n\n            const objects = [];\n            const group = new THREE.Group();\n            scene.add(group);\n\n            const streakGeo = new THREE.BufferGeometry();\n            const streakCount = 400;\n            const streakPositions = new Float32Array(streakCount * 6);\n            const streakColors = new Float32Array(streakCount * 6);\n\n            const colorPalette = [\n                new THREE.Color(0x4488ff),\n                new THREE.Color(0x2255cc),\n                new THREE.Color(0x8844ff),\n                new THREE.Color(0xffffff)\n            ];\n\n            for (let i = 0; i < streakCount; i++) {\n                const angle = Math.random() * Math.PI * 2;\n                const radius = Math.random() * 800 + 20;\n                const x = Math.cos(angle) * radius;\n                const y = Math.sin(angle) * radius;\n                const z = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 2000;\n                const length = Math.random() * 150 + 50;\n\n                streakPositions[i * 6] = x;\n                streakPositions[i * 6 + 1] = y;\n                streakPositions[i * 6 + 2] = z;\n                streakPositions[i * 6 + 3] = x;\n                streakPositions[i * 6 + 4] = y;\n                streakPositions[i * 6 + 5] = z + length;\n\n                const color = colorPalette[Math.floor(Math.random() * colorPalette.length)];\n                streakColors[i * 6] = color.r; streakColors[i * 6 + 1] = color.g; streakColors[i * 6 + 2] = color.b;\n                streakColors[i * 6 + 3] = color.r; streakColors[i * 6 + 4] = color.g; streakColors[i * 6 + 5] = color.b;\n            }\n\n            streakGeo.setAttribute('position', new THREE.BufferAttribute(streakPositions, 3));\n            streakGeo.setAttribute('color', new THREE.BufferAttribute(streakColors, 3));\n            const streakMat = new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({ vertexColors: true, transparent: true, opacity: 0.6, blending: THREE.AdditiveBlending });\n            const streaks = new THREE.LineSegments(streakGeo, streakMat);\n            group.add(streaks);\n\n            const boxGeo = new THREE.PlaneGeometry(8, 20);\n            const boxCount = 40;\n            const boxMaterial = new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({\n                color: 0xffffff,\n                transparent: true,\n                opacity: 0.9,\n                side: THREE.DoubleSide\n            });\n\n            for (let i = 0; i < boxCount; i++) {\n                const mat = boxMaterial.clone();\n                mat.color.setHex(Math.random() > 0.6 ? 0xffbbff : (Math.random() > 0.5 ? 0xddddff : 0xffffff));\n\n                const mesh = new THREE.Mesh(boxGeo, mat);\n                const angle = Math.random() * Math.PI * 2;\n                const radius = Math.random() * 400 + 100;\n                mesh.position.x = Math.cos(angle) * radius;\n                mesh.position.y = Math.sin(angle) * radius;\n                mesh.position.z = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 2000;\n                mesh.lookAt(0, 0, mesh.position.z + 100);\n\n                const scale = Math.random() * 1.5 + 0.5;\n                mesh.scale.set(scale, scale, scale);\n\n                group.add(mesh);\n                objects.push(mesh);\n            }\n\n            const animate = () => {\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n\n                const positions = streaks.geometry.attributes.position.array;\n                const speed = 15;\n                for(let i=0; i<streakCount; i++) {\n                    positions[i*6+2] += speed;\n                    positions[i*6+5] += speed;\n\n                    if(positions[i*6+2] > 200) {\n                        const length = positions[i*6+5] - positions[i*6+2];\n                        positions[i*6+2] = -1800;\n                        positions[i*6+5] = -1800 + length;\n                    }\n                }\n                streaks.geometry.attributes.position.needsUpdate = true;\n\n                objects.forEach(obj => {\n                    obj.position.z += speed;\n                    if (obj.position.z > 200) {\n                        obj.position.z = -1800;\n                    }\n                });\n\n                renderer.render(scene, camera);\n            };\n            animate();\n\n            window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                camera.aspect = canvas.clientWidth / canvas.clientHeight;\n                camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n                renderer.setSize(canvas.clientWidth, canvas.clientHeight);\n            });\n        };\n\n\n        // === 2. Background Grid WebGL ===\n        const initGrid = () => {\n            const { canvas, renderer } = createRenderer('grid-canvas');\n            const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n            scene.fog = new THREE.FogExp2(0x020617, 0.04);\n\n            const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(60, canvas.clientWidth / canvas.clientHeight, 0.1, 100);\n            camera.position.set(0, 4, 10);\n            camera.lookAt(0, 0, -20);\n\n            const gridSize = 100;\n            const gridDivisions = 50;\n            const gridHelper = new THREE.GridHelper(gridSize, gridDivisions, 0x3b82f6, 0xffffff);\n            gridHelper.material.transparent = true;\n            gridHelper.material.opacity = 0.08;\n            gridHelper.position.y = -2;\n            scene.add(gridHelper);\n\n            const particleGeo = new THREE.BufferGeometry();\n            const particleCount = 200;\n            const posArray = new Float32Array(particleCount * 3);\n            for(let i = 0; i < particleCount * 3; i+=3) {\n                posArray[i] = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 40;\n                posArray[i+1] = Math.random() * 10 - 2;\n                posArray[i+2] = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 40;\n            }\n            particleGeo.setAttribute('position', new THREE.BufferAttribute(posArray, 3));\n            const particleMat = new THREE.PointsMaterial({\n                size: 0.05,\n                color: 0x60a5fa,\n                transparent: true,\n                opacity: 0.4,\n                blending: THREE.AdditiveBlending\n            });\n            const particles = new THREE.Points(particleGeo, particleMat);\n            scene.add(particles);\n\n            let mouseX = 0;\n            let mouseY = 0;\n            document.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n                mouseX = (e.clientX / window.innerWidth) * 2 - 1;\n                mouseY = -(e.clientY / window.innerHeight) * 2 + 1;\n            });\n\n            const animate = () => {\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n\n                const gridStep = gridSize / gridDivisions;\n                gridHelper.position.z = (gridHelper.position.z + 0.02) % gridStep;\n\n                camera.position.x += (mouseX * 0.5 - camera.position.x) * 0.05;\n                camera.position.y += ((4 + mouseY * 0.5) - camera.position.y) * 0.05;\n                camera.lookAt(0, 0, -20);\n\n                const positions = particles.geometry.attributes.position.array;\n                for(let i=1; i<particleCount*3; i+=3) {\n                    positions[i] += 0.005;\n                    if(positions[i] > 10) positions[i] = -2;\n                }\n                particles.geometry.attributes.position.needsUpdate = true;\n\n                renderer.render(scene, camera);\n            };\n            animate();\n\n            window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                camera.aspect = canvas.clientWidth / canvas.clientHeight;\n                camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n                renderer.setSize(canvas.clientWidth, canvas.clientHeight);\n            });\n        };\n\n\n        // === 3. Globe Particles WebGL ===\n        const initGlobe = () => {\n            const { canvas, renderer } = createRenderer('globe-canvas');\n            const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n            scene.fog = new THREE.FogExp2(0x01030a, 0.06);\n\n            const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(45, canvas.clientWidth / canvas.clientHeight, 0.1, 100);\n            camera.position.set(0, 0, 18);\n            if(window.innerWidth > 768) {\n                camera.position.x = -4;\n            }\n\n            const globeGroup = new THREE.Group();\n            scene.add(globeGroup);\n\n            const getParticleMaterial = (colorHex, size, opacity) => {\n                const canvas = document.createElement('canvas');\n                canvas.width = 16;\n                canvas.height = 16;\n                const context = canvas.getContext('2d');\n                const gradient = context.createRadialGradient(8, 8, 0, 8, 8, 8);\n                gradient.addColorStop(0, 'rgba(255,255,255,1)');\n                gradient.addColorStop(0.2, 'rgba(255,255,255,0.8)');\n                gradient.addColorStop(1, 'rgba(0,0,0,0)');\n                context.fillStyle = gradient;\n                context.fillRect(0, 0, 16, 16);\n                const texture = new THREE.CanvasTexture(canvas);\n\n                return new THREE.PointsMaterial({\n                    size: size,\n                    map: texture,\n                    transparent: true,\n                    opacity: opacity,\n                    depthWrite: false,\n                    blending: THREE.AdditiveBlending,\n                    color: colorHex\n                });\n            };\n\n            const coreGeo = new THREE.BufferGeometry();\n            const coreCount = 4000;\n            const corePos = new Float32Array(coreCount * 3);\n            const coreRadius = 4;\n            for(let i=0; i<coreCount*3; i+=3) {\n                const u = Math.random();\n                const v = Math.random();\n                const theta = u * 2.0 * Math.PI;\n                const phi = Math.acos(2.0 * v - 1.0);\n                const r = Math.cbrt(Math.random()) * coreRadius;\n\n                corePos[i] = r * Math.sin(phi) * Math.cos(theta);\n                corePos[i+1] = r * Math.sin(phi) * Math.sin(theta);\n                corePos[i+2] = r * Math.cos(phi);\n            }\n            coreGeo.setAttribute('position', new THREE.BufferAttribute(corePos, 3));\n            const coreMat = getParticleMaterial(0xffffff, 0.1, 0.4);\n            const core = new THREE.Points(coreGeo, coreMat);\n            globeGroup.add(core);\n\n            const ringGeo = new THREE.BufferGeometry();\n            const ringCount = 3000;\n            const ringPos = new Float32Array(ringCount * 3);\n            const innerRadius = 4.5;\n            const outerRadius = 8;\n            for(let i=0; i<ringCount*3; i+=3) {\n                const angle = Math.random() * Math.PI * 2;\n                const r = innerRadius + Math.random() * (outerRadius - innerRadius);\n                const ySpread = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.5;\n\n                ringPos[i] = Math.cos(angle) * r;\n                ringPos[i+1] = ySpread;\n                ringPos[i+2] = Math.sin(angle) * r;\n            }\n            ringGeo.setAttribute('position', new THREE.BufferAttribute(ringPos, 3));\n            const ringMat = getParticleMaterial(0x6366f1, 0.15, 0.6);\n            const ring = new THREE.Points(ringGeo, ringMat);\n            globeGroup.add(ring);\n\n            globeGroup.rotation.x = Math.PI * 0.15;\n            globeGroup.rotation.z = Math.PI * 0.1;\n\n            let mouseX = 0;\n            let mouseY = 0;\n            const targetRotationX = globeGroup.rotation.x;\n\n            document.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n                mouseX = (e.clientX / window.innerWidth) * 2 - 1;\n                mouseY = -(e.clientY / window.innerHeight) * 2 + 1;\n            });\n\n            const animate = () => {\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n\n                globeGroup.rotation.y -= 0.002;\n                globeGroup.rotation.x += ((targetRotationX - mouseY * 0.1) - globeGroup.rotation.x) * 0.05;\n\n                const time = Date.now() * 0.001;\n                const scale = 1 + Math.sin(time * 0.5) * 0.02;\n                globeGroup.scale.set(scale, scale, scale);\n\n                renderer.render(scene, camera);\n            };\n            animate();\n\n            window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                camera.aspect = canvas.clientWidth / canvas.clientHeight;\n                if(window.innerWidth > 768) {\n                    camera.position.x = -4;\n                } else {\n                    camera.position.x = 0;\n                }\n                camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n                renderer.setSize(canvas.clientWidth, canvas.clientHeight);\n            });\n        };\n\n        initWarp();\n        initGrid();\n        initGlobe();\n\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "immersive-experience-1.html